      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Archaeologists first explored the site in the 1890s, uncovering mud‑brick stepped pyramids with ramps and plazas that date from the late 1300s to mid‑1400s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
